# LinkedIn

Operations are in `docs/deployment/admin-website.md`. [why: convention]

- Posts must not name LX Software or sibling products unless Settings allows product names. An employer name belongs in Settings, not in source. [why: convention]
- `linkedin_store.RECOMMENDED_VOICE` and `RECOMMENDED_LINKEDIN_VOICE` in `linkedinModel.ts` stay the same text and under 1000 characters. The voice must not quote a catchphrase. [why: convention]
- Image calls use resolution `2K`. Seedream 4.5 rejects `1K`. [why: convention]
- The reference photo and the chosen character sheet stay in the private assets bucket under `linkedin/character/`. Do not copy either into the repo, DynamoDB, or fixtures. [why: convention]
- Rows use the `LINKEDIN#` prefix and stay out of `/records`. [why: convention]
- `LxSoftwareLinkedinEnabled` and `LxSoftwareLinkedinPublishEnabled` default false. [why: convention]
